      <div class="post-meta">A few words</div>
      <p>I'm a high school student interested in electrical and computer engineering, computer science, and physics.</p>
      <p>Mostly this blog is just me writing about things I find interesting — papers I'm reading, projects I'm working on, and bits of research I want to think through more carefully.</p>
      <p>I also do competitive programming on <a href="https://codeforces.com/profile/ndemoss">Codeforces</a>.</p>
      <p>You can find me on <a href="https://x.com/ndemoss28">Twitter</a> and <a href="https://github.com/natedemoss">GitHub</a>.</p>
      <hr />
